    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the batch_publish.py file, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider for publishing messages. I will use Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) as the provider, which is a managed message queuing service provided by AWS. I will import the boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with SQS. The boto3 library and the SQS service will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789864729521,
